<title>HUNGARY: Borsodchem subscription price $18.50/GDR.</title>
<headline>Borsodchem subscription price $18.50/GDR.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The subscription price of an international placement of 1.2 million shares in Hungarian chemical company Borsodchem was set at 2,940 forints/share or $18.50/Global Depositary Receipt (GDR), the Budapest Stock Exchange (BSE) said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The placement allowed the seller, Hungary's state privatisation agency APV Rt to raise 3.53 billion forints or $22.2 million, the BSE said.</p>
